  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify explicit real trigonometric degrees/radians, Gamma pole refusals and principal complex logarithm cut approval in Math scientific preview.4. Recover a compiled public API RED and pass 87 new GREEN, 238 retained tests and four Math regressions. SHA-inspect one real local NuGet archive through two independent eight-probe consumers. Close C02-T2 and phase C02 only; M6-W02/M6, complex Gamma, alternate branches, exact error bounds and public distribution remain open.",
    "value": "Provide fail-closed domain and branch policies without changing T1: typed nonpartial refusals for nonpositive integer Gamma poles, unsupported complex Gamma and nonconsensual log cuts, explicit approximate angular conversion and conservative exponential risk refusal.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS091 success, prepare a mandatory split of M6-W02-C03 L-size geometry/signals/time-series work before activating its numerical contracts. Preserve W02/M6 progress and no public NuGet claims.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Observe one genuinely compiled missing special-function boundary public API RED before staging the sidecar and recover it with 87 new independently asserted GREEN tests.",
      "Require explicit Radians or Degrees for real trig, reject unspecified units, and apply original bounded radian input policy after approximate conversion.",
      "Classify nonpositive integer Gamma poles without pretending to compute analytic continuation; preserve the T1 positive real Lanczos Gamma subset.",
      "Require caller opt-in for the principal complex logarithm on the negative real branch cut; do not add unsupported alternate branches or complex Gamma.",
      "Pre-refuse extreme exponential overflow/underflow risks before delegating to T1, without claiming observed floating-point exceptions or enlarged numeric ranges.",
      "Preserve 80 C02-T1, 88 C01-T2 and 70 C01-T1 targeted tests plus four core regressions and the complete scientific suite.",
      "Pack a real local BCL-only preview.4 archive and compare identical SHA-256 bytes across two independent eight-probe source-free NuGet consumers.",
      "Close C02-T2 R/G/V and phase C02 only; preserve C03 L-size split requirement, M6-W02/M6 and unqualified public/agent adoption."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C02-T2-R",
        "achievement": "Observe one independently compiled absent public angular, Gamma pole and complex branch audit RED on the previous qualified provider."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C02-T2-G",
